              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, bana betu ba tshijila, babanyanganyi ba dibikila dia mu diulu, nuelangane meshi bua Mupostolo ne Muakuidi Munene wa dijukula dia ditabusha dietu, Yesu mene; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakadi wa kueyemenyibua kudi wakamuteka mu mudimu, bu muakadi Mose kabidi mu nsubu mua Nzambi muonso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua yeye wakubadibua muakanangane ne butumbi butambe bua Mose, bualu bua wakibaka nsubu udi ne butumbi butambe butumbi bua nsubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua nsubu yonso udi muibakibue kudi mukuabo, kadi wakibaka bintu bionso nNzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulelela, Mose wakadi wa kueyemenyibua mu nsubu wa Nzambi muonso bu muena mudimu, bua kuikaleye tshimanyishilu tshia malu akadi amba kuambibua ka nyima; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi Kilisto wakadi wa kueyemenyibua bu Muana ku mutu kua nsubu wa Nzambi; tuetu tudi nsubu wandi, bitualamata ku dikima dietu ne ku kutumbila kua ditekemena dietu bikole tô ne kunshikidilu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
